      "title": "[net] seg6: validate SRH length before reading fixed fields",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620-f01-17-seg6-srh-len-v1-1-36cbb29c12f1@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620-f01-17-seg6-srh-len-v1-1-36cbb29c12f1@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620-f01-17-seg6-srh-len-v1-1-36cbb29c12f1@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "d467afd01b5c6e3157f1ca07247cc03a4cf0179e",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Nuoqi Gui",
      "date": "2026-06-20T15:55:51",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 seg6_validate_srh() 中的越界读取漏洞。该函数在验证 SRH（Segment Routing Header）长度之前就读取了 srh->type 等固定字段，导致 BPF SEG6 封装路径（bpf_lwt_push_encap → bpf_push_seg6_encap）中传入过短缓冲区时可能读取越界内存。补丁在 seg6_validate_srh() 入口处增加了 len < sizeof(*srh) 的检查，拒绝过短长度后再访问任何字段，从而加固了 SRH 验证器并修复了 BPF helper 路径的安全问题。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "eBPF",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14637768,
      "title": "[net,v3] net: airoha: fix BQL underflow in shared QDMA TX ring",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620-airoha-bql-fixes-v3-1-76b95374e63e@kernel.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620-airoha-bql-fixes-v3-1-76b95374e63e@kernel.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620-airoha-bql-fixes-v3-1-76b95374e63e@kernel.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "ed5e0754f19d3db7b9a0acab4ba26f7c71f57e3d",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Lorenzo Bianconi",
      "date": "2026-06-20T15:04:51",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Airoha 以太网驱动在多网口共享 QDMA TX 环形队列时出现的 BQL（Byte Queue Limits）计数器下溢问题。当某个 netdev 被 stop 时，`netdev_tx_reset_subqueue()` 会清零该设备的 BQL 计数，但共享硬件环中仍残留未完成的 skb；随后 NAPI 通过 `netdev_tx_completed_queue()` 完成这些 skb 时，导致 `dql->num_queued` 下溢。修复方案是移除 stop 路径中的 reset 调用，改在 cleanup 中统一禁用 TX DMA、刷新 BQL、DMA unmap 并释放挂起 skb，同时引入 per-queue flushing 标志配合 `q->lock` 防止 teardown 与 xmit 之间的竞态，并将 DMA 引擎启动移至 probe 阶段，使 DMA 生命周期与 probe/cleanup 绑定，去除冗余的 `qdma->users` 计数。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 14637742,
      "title": "[net,v2] net: wwan: iosm: bound device offsets in the MUX downlink decoder",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/178196118045.462404.11069139160448641355@maoyixie.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178196118045.462404.11069139160448641355@maoyixie.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178196118045.462404.11069139160448641355@maoyixie.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "80692810724a92af8fbced64ab3e15b64e9d7d6e",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maoyi Xie",
      "date": "2026-06-20T13:13:00",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Intel iosm WWAN 驱动（drivers/net/wwan/iosm）中 MUX 下行解码器的越界读取漏洞。mux_dl_adb_decode() 解析聚合数据报表时所使用的 first_table_index、next_table_index、table_length、datagram_index、datagram_length 等偏移和长度均来自 modem 设备，但原先仅检查了 first_table_index 是否非零，未对 skb->len 做任何边界校验，导致 modem 报告越界值时解码器读取 slab 越界（KASAN 可复现）。补丁在 mux_dl_process_dg() 中增加完整校验：每个表头必须在 skb 内、数据报表必须完整、每个数据报索引和长度不得超出 skb、头填充不能超过数据报长度以防回绕，属于网络驱动侧的硬化修复。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14637709,
      "title": "[net] net: marvell: prestera: use unaligned accessors for DSA tag",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620093739.2164921-1-runyu.xiao@seu.edu.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620093739.2164921-1-runyu.xiao@seu.edu.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620093739.2164921-1-runyu.xiao@seu.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "aae272a153295acd36cd9612f95ef15225379a78",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Runyu Xiao",
      "date": "2026-06-20T09:37:39",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Marvell Prestera 交换机驱动中 DSA 标签解析与构造的对齐问题。原代码将 skb 数据指针直接强制转换为 __be32 * 进行 4 字节读写，但 skb 数据缓冲区并不保证 4 字节自然对齐，在 strict-alignment 架构上会触发未对齐访问错误，UBSAN 已在 prestera_dsa_parse() 中报出 'misaligned-access loads of type __be32'。修改方案是改用 <linux/unaligned.h> 提供的 get_unaligned_be32() / put_unaligned_be32() 辅助函数，跨架构安全地完成 16 字节 DSA 标签的解析与构建，提升驱动可移植性。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14637675,
      "title": "[net,v5] net: airoha: Fix skb->priority underflow in airoha_dev_select_queue()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/178194366700.2485734.5368768965976693502@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178194366700.2485734.5368768965976693502@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178194366700.2485734.5368768965976693502@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "0cb2c8cc011809e91c953a3dcd1683bbe456aaaa",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Wayen Yan",
      "date": "2026-06-20T08:17:44",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Airoha 以太网卡驱动中 `airoha_dev_select_queue()` 的 QoS 队列选择逻辑缺陷。原代码 `queue = (skb->priority - 1) % AIROHA_NUM_QOS_QUEUES` 在 `skb->priority` 为 0（默认未分类流量）时，因无符号算术下溢变为 `UINT_MAX`，取模后映射到最高优先级队列 7，导致 PON 网关场景下大量尽力而为流量抢占 VoIP、游戏等高优先级流的带宽（QoS 反转）。补丁移除多余的 `-1` 偏移，改为直接取模 `skb->priority % AIROHA_NUM_QOS_QUEUES`，使 priority 0 对应队列 0（最低），7 对应队列 7（最高），符合 Linux 标准的 sk_prio → 硬件队列映射规范。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
