    {
      "id": 14637628,
      "title": "[bpf-next,v5,2/3] bpf, sockmap: reject a packet-modifying SK_SKB stream parser",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620024423.4141004-3-rhkrqnwk98@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620024423.4141004-3-rhkrqnwk98@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620024423.4141004-3-rhkrqnwk98@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "88ec32ef11d5eedc5d43cad1b2c96059131e8b2a",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Sechang Lim",
      "date": "2026-06-20T02:44:17",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 sockmap 中 SK_SKB 流解析器（stream parser）修改 skb 数据引发的 UAF 漏洞。strparser 通过 frag_list 链组装消息并由 BPF 解析器测量消息长度，若解析器调用 bpf_skb_change_tail/pull_data/change_head/adjust_room 等写入操作，会触发 __pskb_pull_tail() 释放 strparser 仍在跟踪的 frag_list skb，导致 strp->skb_nextp 指向已释放内存，后续 __strp_recv() 写入时触发 slab-use-after-free（需至少跨三个数据段）。修复方式是在 sock_map_prog_update() 中新增 sock_map_prog_attach_check()，对 BPF_SK_SKB_STREAM_PARSER 类型的程序检查 prog->aux->changes_pkt_data，若为真则返回 -EINVAL 拒绝加载，从而在加载阶段杜绝此类程序。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "Socket",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14637627,
      "title": "[bpf-next,v5,1/3] selftests/bpf: don't modify the skb in the strparser parser prog",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620024423.4141004-2-rhkrqnwk98@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620024423.4141004-2-rhkrqnwk98@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620024423.4141004-2-rhkrqnwk98@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "c628a2d1e91b62820a035adfa675c78271f782a4",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Sechang Lim",
      "date": "2026-06-20T02:44:16",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 selftests/bpf 中 sockmap 解析器程序的错误用法。原来的 sk_skb 流解析器会调用 bpf_skb_pull_data() 并写入数据包字节，违反了 strparser 流解析器只读的要求——因为 resize 会释放 strparser 仍在追踪的 frag_list 段，从而导致 use-after-free。补丁将解析器改为只读，仅返回 skb->len 作为消息长度，从而既能保持测试可附加，也避免触发 UAF，同时为未来拒绝修改数据包的解析器做好兼容。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "Socket",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
