    {
      "id": 14632376,
      "title": "[GIT,PULL] Networking for 7.2",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260617000705.931602-1-kuba@kernel.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260617000705.931602-1-kuba@kernel.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260617000705.931602-1-kuba@kernel.org/mbox/",
      "hash": null,
      "commitRef": "b85966adbf5de0668a815c6e3527f87e0c387fb4",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Jakub Kicinski",
      "date": "2026-06-17T00:07:05",
      "summary": "这是 Linux 7.2 内核网络子系统的 pull request，涵盖多项核心网络改进：1) 继续移除 rtnl_lock 锁保护，包括 IPv6 组播路由配置、ethtool 现代驱动、Qdisc dump 回调等场景；2) 支持在 RCU 保护下仅 dump 接口的 ifindex+名称，避免 CLI 工具频繁获取 rtnl_lock；3) 支持按指定 netdev dump qdiscs 和 page pools，将 O(n^2) 行为优化为 O(n)；4) 多 nexthop 删除时（如设备 down）一次性 flush nexthops，同样是 O(n^2) -> O(n) 的性能优化；5) 将 fib4_rules_exit() 移至 ->exit() 钩子。这些改动主要提升网络栈的并发性能与可扩展性，减少锁竞争。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "路由",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 14632153,
      "title": "[v1,net-next] ipv4: fib_rule: Move fib4_rules_exit() to ->exit().",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260616191359.4142661-1-kuniyu@google.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260616191359.4142661-1-kuniyu@google.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260616191359.4142661-1-kuniyu@google.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "a758705586893d0103839a409a7d7e5ea1153167",
      "commitRef": "d954a67a7dfa58b7a9b3194322d321b940eb60c8",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Kuniyuki Iwashima",
      "date": "2026-06-16T19:13:48",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 IPv4 FIB 规则中 use-after-free 漏洞。之前的提交将 fib4_rules_exit() 移到 ->exit_rtnl()，但 ->exit() 中销毁的 kernel socket 仍可能通过 fou 等机制调用 __fib_lookup()，访问已释放的 rules_ops。修复方案是将 fib4_rules_exit() 移回 ->exit() 回调中执行，并删除 fib4_rule_delete() 中冗余的 fib_unmerge() 调用（因为 ->delete() 在 ->configure() 之后调用，unmerge 已无实际效果）。该修复确保了网络命名空间清理时 rules_ops 的生命周期正确，避免 syzbot 报告的 slab-use-after-free 崩溃。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "路由",
        "容器网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14631995,
      "title": "[net] net: thunderbolt: Fix frags[] overflow by bounding frame_count",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/178163152194.2486768.14724194232649760778@maoyixie.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178163152194.2486768.14724194232649760778@maoyixie.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178163152194.2486768.14724194232649760778@maoyixie.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "49ae99c5c7f0f63673a3f63672953f2be1c89dd7",
      "commitRef": "55d9895f89970501fe126d1026b586b04a224c27",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Maoyi Xie",
      "date": "2026-06-16T17:38:41",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 Thunderbolt 网络驱动（drivers/net/thunderbolt/main.c）中的一个 SKB frags[] 缓冲区溢出漏洞。在 tbnet_poll() 组装多帧 ThunderboltIP 包时，首帧放入 skb 线性区，后续每帧作为一个 page fragment 添加，因此 frame_count 个帧会产生 frame_count-1 个 frags。原代码 tbnet_check_frame() 将 frame_count 上界设为 TBNET_RING_SIZE/4（即 64），远超默认的 MAX_SKB_FRAGS（17），导致恶意对端发送 19 帧以上小帧时 skb_add_rx_frag() 越界写入 frags[]，破坏后续内存（KASAN 可复现）。补丁将上界收紧为 MAX_SKB_FRAGS+1，在入口处直接拒绝超大帧包，防止 skb_shinfo 共享信息被损坏，与 wwan/t7xx、usb/cdc-phonet 等近期同类修复思路一致。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14631472,
      "title": "[v4] flow_dissector: check device type before reading ETH_ADDRS",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260616123057.482154-1-yun.zhou@windriver.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260616123057.482154-1-yun.zhou@windriver.com/",
