      "id": 14630578,
      "title": "[net,v4] virtio-net: fix len check in receive_big()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260616042837.2249468-1-xmei5@asu.edu",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260616042837.2249468-1-xmei5@asu.edu/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260616042837.2249468-1-xmei5@asu.edu/mbox/",
      "hash": "5a41829e2dc9e0db8b0ea2801b604f8af7b31ca2",
      "commitRef": "9e5ad06ea826322ce8c58b4a68442a96f600c3c4",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Xiang Mei",
      "date": "2026-06-16T04:28:37",
      "summary": "virtio-net 驱动中修复 receive_big() 函数的长度校验漏洞。原校验仅用 (big_packets_num_skbfrags + 1) * PAGE_SIZE 作为最大长度上限，但实际 add_recvbuf_big() 分配的 sg 链从第一个页偏移 sizeof(padded_vnet_hdr) 处开始，因此真实可用空间少 sizeof(padded_vnet_hdr) 字节。恶意 virtio 后端可声明处于该间隙的 len，使 page_to_skb() 越界写入 skb_shinfo()->frags[MAX_SKB_FRAGS]，构成越界写并产生 NULL frag 沿 rx 路径上送。补丁将 max_len 重算为 (num_frags+1)*PAGE_SIZE - sizeof(padded_vnet_hdr) + hdr_len，与实际分配大小对齐，消除安全风险。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "虚拟化",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14630442,
      "title": "[net] net: psample: fix info leak in PSAMPLE_ATTR_DATA",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260616003046.1099490-1-kuba@kernel.org",
